{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紫金礦業上半年多賺六成八，純利391.7億元人民幣，中期息每10股派4.2元人民幣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期內收入1,941億元人民幣，按年增加逾一成半。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T23:39:25.326423+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":67,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}